      "name": "UnlinkListNode",
      "signature": "void UnlinkListNode(ListNode * pNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Remove and unlink all nodes from a linked list container structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate pointer to next node field (param_1 + 1)  \n2. While container has elements (param_1[2] > 0):\n   a. Calculate current node address (*param_1 + param_1[2])\n   b. Verify current node has valid data pointer (*piVar4 != 0)\n   c. Extract node offset value (piVar4[1]) for relinking\n   d. Calculate target position for relinking:\n      - If offset negative: Use bitwise complement (~uVar2) as direct pointer\n      - If offset positive: Calculate relative position ((int)piVar4 + (uVar2 - *(int *)(*piVar4 + 4)))\n   e. Relink nodes: Update target pointer (*piVar5 = *piVar4)\n   f. Update source node back-reference (*(int *)(*piVar4 + 4) = piVar4[1])\n   g. Clear current node pointers (*piVar4 = 0, piVar4[1] = 0)\n3. Process next node pointer (iVar3 = *piVar1):\n   a. If next node exists (iVar3 != 0)\n   b. Extract container offset value (uVar2 = param_1[2])\n   c. Calculate target position using same logic as step 2d\n   d. Relink next node (*piVar4 = iVar3)\n   e. Update back-reference (*(int *)(*piVar1 + 4) = param_1[2])\n   f. Clear next pointer and container count (*piVar1 = 0, param_1[2] = 0)\n\nParameters:\nparam_1 (int*) - Pointer to linked list container structure\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If container is empty (param_1[2] <= 0), skips element processing\n- Handles negative offset values as direct pointers using bitwise complement\n- Safely handles NULL node pointers by checking *piVar4 != 0\n- Clears all pointers to prevent dangling references\n\nStructure Layout:\nContainer Structure (12+ bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type              Description\n0x0     4     pData            void*            Pointer to data/first node\n0x4     4     pNext            ListNode*        Pointer to next node  \n0x8     4     nCount           int              Number of elements\n\nListNode Structure (8+ bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type              Description\n0x0     4     pData            void*            Pointer to node data\n0x4     4     pNext            ListNode*        Pointer to next node\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x0 - NULL pointer value for clearing references\n0x4 - Offset to next pointer field in ListNode structure",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
