      "name": "GetLinkedListOffset",
      "signature": "uint GetLinkedListOffset(void * this, int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Calculates adjusted offset for linked list node navigation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read stored offset from pNode+4\n2. If offset is negative (sentinel), return bitwise NOT (~offset)\n3. If nOffset < 0, compute base offset: pNode - *(pNode->pListHead + 4)\n4. Return offset + nOffset\n\nParameters:\n- this (void*): Pointer to linked list node structure\n- nOffset (int): Offset adjustment (-1 = auto-compute from list head)\n\nReturns:\n- Calculated offset/position within the linked list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- +0x4: Node offset field\n- Negative offset: Sentinel marker (inverted to get actual value)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:62170be0c28808a8aad285132828690d2fe32ddbbb710e689ae8821348f4d2bc",
