      "name": "GetGameEntry",
      "signature": "dword * GetGameEntry(void * this, uint param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "dword *",
      "comment": "GAMEDATA_GetGameEntry - Looks up a game entry in the game data hash table by game ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute hash bucket index from dwGameId using mask at offset 0x24\n2. Get initial entry pointer from hash table at offset 0x1c\n3. Walk linked list of entries until matching dwGameId found or list exhausted\n4. Return pointer to game entry or NULL if not found\n\nParameters:\n  pGameData - Pointer to game data manager structure containing hash table\n  dwGameId - Game ID to search for in the hash table\n\nReturns: Pointer to game entry structure if found, NULL otherwise",
