      "name": "AddIntegers",
      "signature": "int AddIntegers(int nValue1, int nValue2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Performs integer addition of two values using efficient LEA instruction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load parameters from ECX (nValue1) and EDX (nValue2) registers\n2. Use LEA instruction to compute sum: EAX = ECX + EDX\n3. Return sum in EAX register\n\nParameters:\nnValue1 (int): First integer operand passed in ECX register\nnValue2 (int): Second integer operand passed in EDX register\n\nReturns:\nint: Sum of nValue1 + nValue2\n\nSpecial Cases:\nUses LEA (Load Effective Address) instruction for efficient addition\nNo overflow checking - standard 32-bit signed integer arithmetic\nFunction follows __fastcall convention with parameters in ECX/EDX",
