      "name": "InitializeExplicitListNode",
      "signature": "void InitializeExplicitListNode(TSExplicitListNode * pListNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a TSExplicitListNode with signature and circular self-referencing pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pListNode is not NULL to avoid null pointer dereference\n2. Calculate pointer to pNext field (second DWORD of structure)\n3. Initialize pNext field to NULL (zero)\n4. Initialize dwInvertedNext field to zero \n5. Set pNext to point to itself (circular self-reference)\n6. Set dwSignature to validation magic value 0xDDDDDDDD\n7. Set dwInvertedNext to bitwise NOT of pNext address for integrity check\n\nParameters:\npListNode - Pointer to TSExplicitListNode structure to initialize\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nIf pListNode is NULL, function returns immediately without any operations\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xDDDDDDDD - List node signature for validation and debugging\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type                 | Description\n0x00   | 4    | dwSignature     | uint                 | Magic validation signature\n0x04   | 4    | pNext           | TSExplicitListNode * | Pointer to next node in list  \n0x08   | 4    | dwInvertedNext  | uint                 | Bitwise NOT of pNext for integrity",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
