      "name": "InitializeGraphicsSystem",
      "signature": "void InitializeGraphicsSystem(void * pMemoryBase, dword dwUnknown2, dword dwSurfaceCount, dword dwPaletteSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes the graphics subsystem including sprite cache, surface buffers, and palette cache.\nSets up all global graphics state required before rendering operations can begin.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize sprite decompression mutex via InitializeSpriteDecompressionLock\n2. If dwPaletteSize is 0, retrieve palette size from Fog state structure at offset 0xC\n3. Compute graphics mode flag: (paletteSize - 0xB00000) >= 0x4000000 results in 0, else 1\n4. Store graphics mode flag to g_dwGraphicsMode global variable\n5. Clear main graphics buffer via ClearBuffer on g_pGraphicsBuffer\n6. Zero 13 DWORDs (52 bytes) of sprite cache header at g_pSpriteCacheHeader using REP STOSD\n7. Initialize sprite cache linked list via InitializeLinkedListStructure with callback\n8. Zero 16384 DWORDs (64KB) of surface buffer at g_pSurfaceBuffer using REP STOSD\n9. Initialize surface buffer structure via ZeroBufferDwords helper function\n10. Zero 15 DWORDs (60 bytes) of palette cache header at g_pPaletteCacheHeader\n11. Initialize palette cache with viewport initialization callback at 0x6fe1c1b0\n\nParameters:\npMemoryPool (MemoryPool *) - Base memory pool pointer for graphics allocation\ndwUnknown2 (dword) - Unknown parameter passed to linked list initializer\ndwSurfaceCount (dword) - Number of surfaces to allocate in the buffer pool\ndwPaletteSize (dword) - Palette memory size in bytes; pass 0 to auto-detect from Fog state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; function initializes global graphics state\n\nGlobal Variables Modified:\ng_dwGraphicsMode @ 0x6ff12c34 - Graphics mode flag (0 or 1 based on palette threshold)\ng_pSpriteCacheHeader @ 0x6ff02c00 - Sprite cache linked list header (52 bytes zeroed)\ng_pSurfaceBuffer @ 0x6fef2bc0 - Surface buffer array (64KB zeroed then initialized)\ng_pPaletteCacheHeader @ 0x6ff02bc0 - Palette cache header structure (60 bytes zeroed)\ng_pGraphicsBuffer @ 0x6fef1bc0 - Main graphics buffer (cleared via ClearBuffer)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0xB00000 - Palette base offset subtracted from raw palette size value\n0x4000000 - Graphics mode threshold (64MB); sizes below use mode 1\n0xD (13) - DWORD count for sprite cache header structure\n0x4000 (16384) - DWORD count for surface buffer (64KB total)\n0xF (15) - DWORD count for palette cache header structure\n\nError Handling:\nIf Fog state pointer is unavailable when dwPaletteSize is 0, function calls\nFogAssert with source location and then ReportError(-1) to signal fatal error",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
