      "name": "UnlinkSpriteFromCache",
      "signature": "void UnlinkSpriteFromCache(int * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Unlinks a sprite element from the sprite cache linked list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get sprite element pointer from context at offset +8\n2. Clear the element's cache flag at offset 0x24\n3. Call UnlinkListElement to remove from cache list\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (int*): Graphics context containing sprite pointer at offset +8\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: Offset to sprite element pointer in context\n- 0x24: Cache status flag offset in sprite element (cleared to 0)",
