      "name": "ValidateHeapIntegrity",
      "signature": "undefined4 ValidateHeapIntegrity(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "ValidateHeapIntegrity - Validates the internal consistency of a custom heap allocator\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify the heap control block is accessible via IsBadWritePtr\n2. For each allocation slot (stride 0x14 bytes):\n   a. Validate the region metadata pointer (0x41C4 bytes per region)\n   b. For each of 32 regions per slot:\n      i. Validate the virtual memory page (0x8000 bytes)\n      ii. For each of 8 pages per region:\n          - Verify sentinel markers at page boundaries (must be -1)\n          - Traverse all blocks checking size constraints:\n            * Minimum size: 0x10 bytes (16-byte aligned)\n            * Maximum size: 0xFF0 bytes\n            * Maximum alloc flag size: 0x400\n          - Verify block header/footer consistency\n          - Count allocations per size class (64 classes)\n      iii. Verify free list integrity for each size class:\n           - Validate forward/backward pointers\n           - Verify size class indices match\n           - Count free nodes\n      iv. Reconstruct bitmap from free list and compare to stored bitmap\n   c. Compare local bitmap with global slot bitmap\n3. Return 0 on success, negative error code on failure\n\nParameters:\n(none - uses global heap state at 0x0041384C and 0x00413850)\n\nReturns:\n 0: Heap integrity verified successfully\n-1: Heap control block inaccessible\n-2: Region metadata pointer invalid\n-4: Virtual memory page inaccessible\n-5: Page sentinel marker corrupted\n-6: Allocated block size exceeds maximum\n-7: Block size invalid (alignment or bounds)\n-8: Block header/footer mismatch\n-9: Allocated block count mismatch\n-10: Free node pointer out of valid range\n-11: Free list structure corrupted\n-12: Free node in wrong size class\n-13: Free node back pointer mismatch\n-14: Free list node count mismatch\n-15: Free list head pointer invalid\n-16: Computed bitmap differs from stored\n-17: Global slot bitmap mismatch\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x41C4   - Region metadata structure size\n0x8000   - Virtual memory page size\n0x1000   - Page stride for block traversal\n0x204    - Metadata stride per region\n0x14     - Slot structure stride\n0x10     - Minimum block size (16 bytes)\n0xFF0    - Maximum block size\n0x400    - Maximum allocation flag threshold\n0x3F     - Maximum size class index (63)\n0x40     - Total size class count (64)\n0x20     - Regions per slot (32)\n0x8      - Pages per region\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x00    4     dwBitmapLow        Global bitmap (classes 0-31)\n0x04    4     dwBitmapHigh       Global bitmap (classes 32-63)\n0x08    4     dwFlags            Region flags\n0x0C    4     pVirtualMemBase    Pointer to virtual memory\n0x10    4     pRegionMetadata    Pointer to region metadata",
