      "comment": "Determines if the operating system is Windows NT (2000, XP, Vista, 7, etc.)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate and initialize OSVERSIONINFOA structure on stack (0x94 bytes)\n2. Call GetVersionExA() to populate version information\n3. Check if call succeeded and dwPlatformId equals 0x2 (VER_PLATFORM_WIN32_NT)\n4. Return TRUE if Windows NT, FALSE otherwise\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  EAX = TRUE (1) if OS is Windows NT; FALSE (0) if not\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  If GetVersionExA() fails, returns FALSE\n  Checks dwPlatformId field (offset 0x4 in OSVERSIONINFOA)",
