      "name": "SerializeMapProjectData",
      "signature": "void SerializeMapProjectData(uint * pSrcProject, uint * pDstBuffer, uint * pnDataSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Serializes map project data into a contiguous buffer for storage or transmission.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input parameters (pSrcProject, pDstBuffer, pnDataSize must be non-NULL)\n2. Validate project has data entries at offset 0x10c\n3. Calculate total buffer size: header (0x114) + (entryCount * 96) + slot data sizes\n4. Allocate serialization buffer via FogMemAlloc (Ordinal_10042)\n5. Zero-fill the allocated buffer\n6. Copy fixed header (0x114 bytes = 0x45 DWORDs) from source project\n7. For each project entry (outer loop):\n   a. Initialize slot header at destination\n   b. Copy slot table entries (count * 20 bytes each)\n   c. For each slot entry (inner loop):\n      - Copy variable-length data\n      - Store relative offset in entry table\n8. Set serialization flags on source (|= 0x2) and destination (|= 0x6)\n\nParameters:\n  pSrcProject - Pointer to source map project structure to serialize\n  pDstBuffer - Output pointer to receive allocated buffer address\n  pnDataSize - Output pointer to receive total serialized data size\n\nReturns:\n  void (outputs via pDstBuffer and pnDataSize pointers)\n\nStructure Layout (Source Project):\n  Offset  Size   Field              Description\n  0x004   4      dwFlags            Project state flags\n  0x10C   4      nEntryCount        Number of data entries\n  0x110   4      pSlotData          Pointer to slot data array\n\nSlot Data Structure (stride 0x60):\n  Offset  Size   Field              Description\n  0x50    4      nSlotCount         Number of slots in this entry\n  0x54    4      pSlotEntries       Pointer to slot entry array\n\nSlot Entry Structure (stride 0x14):\n  Offset  Size   Field              Description\n  0x0A    2      wDataSize          Size of variable data\n  0x10    4      pData              Pointer to variable data\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x114 - Fixed header size (276 bytes = 0x45 DWORDs)\n  0x60  - Slot data structure stride\n  0x14  - Slot entry structure stride (20 bytes)\n  0x50  - Offset to slot count in slot data\n  0x54  - Offset to slot entries pointer\n\nError Handling:\n  Calls FogAssert via ReportError if any validation fails, then terminates",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:c56b719dea05b232f1a3959f70443434",
