      "signature": "int LoadSpriteHeaderData(dword dwContext, byte * pbOutputBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Loads sprite header data from file into output buffer structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call SetAsyncFileHandle to initialize file context\n2. If initialization fails (dwReadBytes == 0), return 0\n3. Call ReadFileAsync to read 0x0F bytes of header signature\n4. Validate header: must be 0x0F bytes with signature char 't' (0x74)\n5. If valid, populate output buffer fields at offsets 0x04, 0x08, 0x0C, 0x14, 0x18\n6. Validate direction count: if byValue > 0x20 (32), assert and exit fatal\n7. Calculate data size: nResult = byValue * 4\n8. Call ReadFileAsync to read direction data array\n9. Validate: read must succeed and dwBytesRead must equal requested size\n10. Call GetFileSize and store at [pbOutputBuffer + byValue*4 + 0x1C]\n11. Call CloseFileHandle to clean up file context\n12. Set loaded flag (0x02) in pbOutputBuffer[0]\n13. Return 1 (success)\n14. On any failure, call CloseFileHandle and return 0\n\nParameters:\n  dwContext (ECX) - File context handle or resource identifier\n  pbOutputBuffer (EDX) - Pointer to output structure receiving sprite header\n\nReturns:\n  EAX: 1 on success, 0 on failure\n\nFOG.DLL Function Mappings:\n  SetAsyncFileHandle - Initialize async file handle\n  CloseFileHandle - Close async file handle  \n  ReadFileAsync - Read file data asynchronously\n  GetFileSize - Get file size in bytes\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 if initial file context initialization fails\n  - Returns 0 if header signature validation fails\n  - Exits via ReportError(0xFFFFFFFF) if direction count > 32 (fatal)\n  - Returns 0 if direction data read fails or byte count mismatch\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x0F - Header signature size (15 bytes)\n  0x74 - Expected signature char 't'\n  0x20 - Maximum direction count (32)\n  0x1C - Base offset for direction data array\n  0x02 - Loaded flag bit in output structure\n  0x4F9 - Source line number for assertion (1273)\n\nStructure Layout (SpriteHeader at pbOutputBuffer):\n  Offset | Size | Field      | Description\n  0x00   | 1    | byFlags    | Flags (bit 0x02 = loaded)\n  0x04   | 4    | dwField1   | First extracted header field\n  0x08   | 4    | dwField2   | Second extracted header field\n  0x0C   | 4    | dwReserved | Reserved (cleared to 0)\n  0x14   | 4    | dwDirCount | Direction count (max 32)\n  0x18   | 4    | dwField3   | Third extracted header field\n  0x1C   | N*4  | adwDirData | Direction data array",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:b2335df3d8e8263ae403011449f73379",
