      "name": "CompressPalette",
      "signature": "undefined CompressPalette(undefined4 * param_1, undefined4 * param_2, undefined4 param_3, undefined * param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Compresses a source palette by applying a transform function to each non-transparent color.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input parameters (pPaletteData, pSourceData, source buffer pointer)\n2. Copy 20 bytes (5 DWORDs) of palette header from source to destination\n3. Clear ownership flag and buffer pointer in destination structure\n4. Calculate compressed size = colorCount / 3 (RGB triplet to byte)\n5. Validate compressed size is within 16-bit range (< 65536)\n6. Allocate compressed buffer via FogMemAlloc\n7. Zero-initialize the allocated buffer\n8. Set ownership flag (bit 0) indicating we own the buffer\n9. For each color triplet in source:\n   a. Check if color matches transparency color (dwColors parameter)\n   b. If transparent, write 0 to output\n   c. If not transparent, call pfnTransformFunc(R, G, B) to get compressed byte\n   d. Write result to output buffer\n\nParameters:\n   pPaletteData (ECX): Destination palette structure pointer (modified)\n   pSourceData (EDX): Source palette data with colors at offset 0x10\n   dwColors (Stack+4): Transparency color to skip (RGB packed as DWORD)\n   pfnTransformFunc (Stack+8): Function pointer (R, G, B) -> byte\n\nReturns:\n   void - Results stored in pPaletteData structure\n\nStructure Layout (Palette):\n   Offset  Size  Field         Type    Description\n   0x00    4     dwField0      dword   Copied from source\n   0x04    4     dwField1      dword   Copied from source\n   0x08    2     wFlags        word    Bit 0 = owns buffer\n   0x0A    2     wColorCount   word    Number of colors in compressed buffer\n   0x0C    4     dwField3      dword   Copied from source\n   0x10    4     pBuffer       dword*  Pointer to compressed color buffer\n\nError Handling:\n   Calls FogAssert and ReportError(-1) on validation failures\n\nMagic Numbers:\n   0x55555556: Multiply constant for fast division by 3\n   0xFFFE: Mask to clear ownership flag (bit 0)\n   0x10000: Maximum compressed size limit (65536)",
