      "name": "InitializePoolSlotLink",
      "signature": "void InitializePoolSlotLink(void * this, undefined4 * param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a bidirectional link structure for an entity pool slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if slot pointer is null (pSlot in ECX)\n2. If null, clean up SEH frame and return early\n3. If valid slot pointer:\n   a. Calculate pointer to pNext field at offset +0x4 from slot base\n   b. Zero initialize pNext field (+0x4) and invPrev field (+0x8)\n   c. Dereference pOldSlotData parameter to get original slot data value\n   d. Store pNext field pointing to itself (self-link for bidirectional access)\n   e. Store original slot data at offset +0x0 of slot structure\n   f. Compute bitwise NOT of pNext pointer and store in invPrev (+0x8)\n4. Clean up SEH frame and return\n\nParameters:\n  pSlot (ECX): Pointer to PoolSlotLink structure (12 bytes total)\n    Offset +0x0: data field - original slot data value (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x4: pNext field - self-link pointer (DWORD*)\n    Offset +0x8: invPrev field - inverted pNext for validation (DWORD)\n  pOldSlotData (Stack[0x8]): Pointer to original slot data to preserve\n\nReturns:\n  void (modifies PoolSlotLink structure in-place)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Null slot pointer: Early return without structure initialization (0x6fbf351e)\n  Self-link pattern: pNext points to its own location at slot+0x4\n  Inverse validation: invPrev stores bitwise NOT of pNext for cross-validation\n  Exception handling: Wrapped in SEH frame (handler at 0x6fc31e2a)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:e02f3e31cdea530144b840a49b93b45036795d1cb7a8f7f746cf5fcd61cea590",
