      "name": "ReleaseStreamLock",
      "signature": "void ReleaseStreamLock(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Releases critical section lock for a stream resource.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load stream table base from g_pStreamTableBase\n2. Calculate stream handle address\n3. Push stream handle onto stack\n4. Push dwStreamIndex onto stack\n5. Call LeaveCriticalSectionDispatcher\n6. Clean stack parameters\n7. Return to caller\n8. Lock released\n\nParameters:\n  dwStreamIndex: Index into stream table array\n\nReturns:\n  void: No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Critical section synchronization wrapper",
