      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Wrapper function that unwraps a list node container and delegates to UnlinkListNode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load container pointer from stack parameter [EBP - 0x10]\n2. Jump to UnlinkListNode implementation at 0x6fbf4c20\n\nParameters:\n  pContainer - Pointer to node container structure to unlink from list\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  This is a wrapper/thunk function that simply forwards execution to UnlinkListNode.\n  Used as an export function or indirect call target.\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Container structure used by UnlinkListNode:\n    Offset    Size    Field Name        Type       Description\n    ------    ----    ----------        ----       -----------\n    +0x00     4       unknown           dword      reserved/padding\n    +0x04     4       pointerTable      dword*     base address of pointer table\n    +0x08     4       listHead1         dword*     primary list head pointer\n    +0x0c     4       listBack1         dword*     primary list back pointer\n    +0x28     4       listOffsetMode    int        offset mode indicator for list2\n    +0x2c     4       listHead2         dword*     secondary list head pointer\n    +0x30     4       listBack2         dword*     secondary list back pointer",
