      "name": "SearchNodeListForItem",
      "signature": "void * SearchNodeListForItem(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Searches a linked list of nodes for an item matching a search key.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the head node pointer from DAT_6fe88328 (global list start)\n2. Check if list is empty (jump to return 0 if null)\n3. Loop through nodes: for each node, load its data section pointer at offset +0x104\n4. Load item count from data section offset +0x10c, skip node if count <= 0\n5. Load first item array pointer from data section offset +0x110\n6. Inner loop: iterate through items with stride 0x60 (96 bytes per item)\n7. Compare EBX (search key in implicit register) with current item address (ESI)\n8. If match found, return the parent data structure in EAX\n9. If no match in current node, advance to next node via pointer at node offset +0x10c\n10. Repeat until list exhausted, return 0 if item not found\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT: EBX register contains the search key (item address to find)\n\nReturns:\nEAX = pointer to the parent data structure containing the matched item, or 0 if not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Empty list (DAT_6fe88328 = 0) returns 0\n- Node with zero items (offset +0x10c = 0) is skipped\n- Each item occupies 0x60 (96) bytes in the array\n- Node link is at offset +0x10c from the current node start\n- Data section is accessed via offset +0x104 from node pointer\n\nStructure Layout:\nNode Structure:\n  Offset   Size   Field Name        Type    Description\n  +0x104   4      pDataSection      ptr     Pointer to data section with items\n  +0x10c   4      pNextNode/count   ptr     Next node pointer (also item count in data section)\n\nData Structure:\n  Offset   Size   Field Name        Type    Description\n  +0x10c   4      itemCount         uint    Number of items in array\n  +0x110   4      pItemArray        ptr     Pointer to first item (0x60-byte stride)",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4d1420db3fd8c8c52e25d49e8c2a1dfb",
