      "name": "GenerateBlendedPaletteColorMaps",
      "signature": "void GenerateBlendedPaletteColorMaps(int pPaletteData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Generates 12 blended palette color maps by computing scaled RGB values for each palette.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize outer loop counter to 12 palettes\n2. Set palette output pointer to data offset 0x6b727\n3. Set blend source pointer to data offset 0x6b604 (RGB blend values)\n4. Iterate outer loop 12 times (one per palette):\n   a. Initialize inner loop counter to 0\n   b. Iterate inner loop 256 times (one per color index):\n      - Load source color intensity from palette at offset (colorIndex * 4)\n      - Calculate scaled red component: (blendRed * intensity) / 0xff\n      - Calculate scaled green component: (blendGreen * intensity) / 0xff\n      - Calculate scaled blue component: (blendBlue * intensity) / 0xff\n      - Call FindClosestPaletteColor to find best palette match\n      - Store result in output palette\n      - Increment color index\n   c. Advance output pointer by 256 bytes to next palette\n   d. Advance blend source pointer by 3 bytes to next RGB triple\n   e. Decrement palette counter\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pPaletteData: Base pointer to palette data structure containing:\n    - Offset +0: 256-color source palette\n    - Offset +0x6b604: 12 RGB triples for blending (36 bytes total)\n    - Offset +0x6b727: Output area for 12 blended palettes (3072 bytes total)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Generates palette data in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Fixed palette size: 256 colors per palette\n  - Fixed blend palette count: 12 palettes\n  - Fixed RGB triple size: 3 bytes per palette (1 byte each component)\n  - Intensity multiplication uses fixed divisor 0xff (255)\n  - Output offset 0x6b727 implies 27951 bytes of palette data follow source palette\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name           | Type     | Description\n  -------|------|----------------------|----------|---------------------------------------------\n  +0     | 256  | colorPalette         | byte[256]| Source palette (256 color indices)\n  +0x6b604 | 36 | blendRGBValues       | byte[36] | 12 RGB triples for color blending (3 bytes each)\n  +0x6b727 | 3072| outputPalettes       | byte[3072]| Output area for 12 generated palettes (256 bytes each)",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
