      "signature": "void InitializeSpriteCacheGrid(int resourceType, int callbackFunc)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes a 2D grid-based sprite cache structure with bidirectional linked list pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store resource parameters in cache manager structure (resourceType at +0x0, callback at +0x2c)\n2. Allocate 141,312 bytes (0x23000) for grid node pool using AllocateAndValidateResource\n3. Initialize entire allocation to zero using REP STOSD (0x8c00 dwords)\n4. For each of 5120 grid nodes (0x1400 nodes \u00d7 5 stride), establish bidirectional links:\n   - Initialize node data fields (12 bytes per node) to zero\n   - Link to next node in grid (if not at boundary 0x13ff)\n   - Link to previous node in grid (if not at boundary 0)\n   - Repeat for 5 node offsets (0x38, 0x54, 0x70, 0x8c offset pattern)\n5. Set grid start and end pointers in cache manager\n6. Initialize cache state fields to zero\n7. Allocate and initialize critical section for thread-safe access\n8. Return (void)\n\nParameters:\n  resourceType (ECX): Resource or cache type identifier\n  callbackFunc (EDX): Callback function pointer for resource events\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Grid dimension is 0x1400 (5120) nodes\n  - Stride pattern is 0x8c (140) bytes per node\n  - Boundary value 0x13ff (5119) prevents linking beyond grid bounds\n  - Total allocation 0x23000 (141,312) bytes for node pool\n  - Critical section allocated only if not previously initialized (offset +0x30)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field Name              Type      Description\n0x0     4     resourceType            uint      Resource/cache type identifier\n0x4     4     pGridData               void*     Pointer to allocated grid node pool\n0x8     4     statusFlag              uint      Status/state tracking flag\n0xc     4     criticalSection         void*     Critical section object pointer\n0x10    4     pNodePool               void*     Base pointer to node allocation\n0x14    4     state1                  uint      State field 1\n0x18    4     state2                  uint      State field 2\n0x1c    4     state3                  uint      State field 3\n0x20    4     state4                  uint      State field 4\n0x24    4     pGridStart              void*     Start of grid memory\n0x28    4     pGridEnd                void*     End of grid memory (start + 0x22fe4)\n0x2c    4     callbackFunc            void*     Resource callback function pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
