      "name": "InitializeEntityGfxResource",
      "signature": "uint InitializeEntityGfxResource(void * this, void * pEntity, uint * pOutResult)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Initializes graphics resource for an entity by computing stride, searching cache, and loading data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate entity pointer (ESI); abort if null\n2. Check if entity has existing resource slot (offset 0x34)\n3. If resource exists, get table element and store at offset 0x3c\n4. Mark resource as initialized in flags (offset 0x44) if cache hit\n5. If no resource, call InitializeEntityResource to get resource structure\n6. Validate resource structure returned from initialization\n7. Search graphics cache using SearchHashTableBucket for matching resource\n8. If cache entry found, extract context pointer from offset 0x20\n9. Check resource flag bit 0 to set entity flag 0x4 at offset 0x44\n10. Return 1 if cache found and resource exists\n11. If no cache entry, calculate stride from resource width/height (offset 0x40)\n12. Normalize stride by dividing by height dimension (offset 0x14)\n13. Search cache again with calculated stride parameters\n14. Validate cache result and element validity with error codes 0x7d2, 0x7d3\n15. Store stride value at entity offset 0x40\n16. Load entity data file using GetEntityDataFilePath\n17. Initialize graphics cache node with InitializeGfxCacheNode\n18. Return 1 on success\n\nParameters:\n- pEntity: Pointer to entity structure (this pointer in ECX)\n- pOutResult: Optional pointer to output result value\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Resource initialized successfully\n- 0: Initialization failed (null entity, null result, or error loading data)\n\nStructure Layout (Entity @ ESI):\nOffset  Size  Field Name              Type    Description\n0x04    1     Flags                   byte    Resource flags (bit 0 = cache valid)\n0x34    4     ResourceSlot            dword   Existing resource slot index\n0x3c    4     ResourceTableElement    ptr     Resource element pointer\n0x40    4     ResourceStride          dword   Graphics stride/pitch value\n0x44    4     EntityFlags             dword   Entity flags (bit 0x4 = resource ready)",
