      "name": "ValidateLinkedListIntegrity",
      "signature": "void ValidateLinkedListIntegrity(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Validates integrity of hash-table-based linked list structure and aborts if corruption is detected.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize slot counter to 0\n2. For each of 512 hash table slots (0x200 total):\n   a. Load pointer to first node in slot from [EDI + 0x800 + slotIndex * 4]\n   b. For each node in chain (following next pointer at offset +0x2c):\n      - Load node's self-reference index from [node + 0x0]\n      - Check if hash table slot [EDI + 0x800 + nodeIndex * 4] points to this node\n      - If not the owner, unlink the orphan node from the chain\n      - Deallocate the orphaned node's memory\n   c. Check validation flag at [EDI + slotIndex * 4]\n   d. If flag is nonzero, corruption detected - abort with cleanup\n   e. Increment slot counter and repeat until all slots checked\n3. If all slots validated successfully, return normally\n4. If corruption found, call cleanup handler and exit with code -1\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT EDI (pGameState) - Pointer to game state structure containing linked list hashtable\n  * HashTable at offset 0x800: Array of 512 (0x200) node pointers\n  * ValidationFlags at offset 0x0: Array of 512 validation status flags\n  * Each node structure:\n    - Offset 0x0: Self-reference index (node's slot in hash table)\n    - Offset 0x2c: Pointer to next node in chain (0 = end of chain)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function does not return normally. On successful validation, returns to caller.\nOn corruption detection, calls abort handler and exits with code -1.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Empty slots: JZ at 0x6fe22bcd skips validation if slot pointer is NULL\n- Orphaned nodes: Nodes with mismatched hash table ownership are automatically unlinked\n- All nodes must reference valid indices 0-511 for correct operation\n- Maximum 512 slots checked (0x200); loop counter overflow tested at 0x6fe22c0c\n- If any slot's validation flag is nonzero after traversal, fatal corruption detected",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:b8b6207501452ff528dba5c0d95a93d4",
