      "name": "AllocateTimedSpellEffect",
      "signature": "void AllocateTimedSpellEffect(int * pEffectState, undefined4 * pEffectType, int nXCoord, int nYCoord, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a timed spell effect with specified coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pEffectState pointer is not null (error 0x100 if null)\n2. Validate that pEffectType pointer is not null (error 0x101 if null)\n3. Call FUN_6fe25920 to validate effect type - return if validation fails\n4. Allocate effect node via FUN_6fe25ab0 - error 0x109 if allocation fails\n5. Link effect node into effect state linked list at offset +0x58 with previous pointer at +0x10\n6. Increment effect count at offset +0x54\n7. Validate coordinates are within valid range (< 0x10000) - error 0x112 if out of bounds\n8. Store X coordinate (nXCoord) as word at effect node offset 0x0\n9. Store Y coordinate (nYCoord) as word at effect node offset 0x2\n10. Allocate 0xc00 bytes (3072 bytes) for effect buffer via AllocateMemoryWithTracking\n11. Zero-fill buffer using REP STOSD (error 0x11a if allocation fails)\n12. Initialize effect node fields:\n    - Offset +0x8: Set to 0xc00 (buffer size)\n    - Offset +0xc: Set to allocated buffer pointer\n    - Offset +0x6: Set to buffer pointer (duplicate)\n    - Offset +0x3: Set to 0x1001 (effect type/flags)\n13. Call FUN_6fe19500 to initialize effect data (memory copy/initialization)\n14. Update pEffectState bounds tracking:\n    - Compare nXCoord against offset 0x0 (min X) - update if smaller\n    - Compare nXCoord + 0x20 against offset 0x8 (max X) - update if larger\n    - Compare nYCoord against offset 0x4 (max Y) - update if larger\n    - Compare nYCoord - 0x20 against offset 0xc (min Y) - update if smaller\n15. Return on success\n\nParameters:\n  pEffectState (int *): Pointer to effect manager state structure tracking bounds and effect list\n  pEffectType (undefined4 *): Pointer to effect type/definition data\n  nXCoord (int): X coordinate for effect placement (must be < 0x10000)\n  nYCoord (int): Y coordinate for effect placement (must be < 0x10000)\n  param_5 (int): Unknown parameter (validated range check)\n\nReturns:\n  void: Function terminates process on any error via exit(-1)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Null pEffectState: Error 0x100, calls CleanupAndAbort and exit(-1)\n  - Null pEffectType: Error 0x101, calls CleanupAndAbort and exit(-1)\n  - Effect type validation fails: Silent return (FUN_6fe25920 failure)\n  - Node allocation fails: Error 0x109, calls CleanupAndAbort and exit(-1)\n  - Buffer allocation fails: Error 0x11a, calls CleanupAndAbort and exit(-1)\n  - Coordinates out of bounds: Error 0x112, calls CleanupAndAbort and exit(-1)\n  - All error paths call GetReturnAddress with error code then CleanupAndAbort\n\nStructure Layout (pEffectState):\n  Offset  Size  Field Name        Type      Description\n  +0x0    4     min_x_bound       int       Minimum X coordinate\n  +0x4    4     max_y_bound       int       Maximum Y coordinate\n  +0x8    4     max_x_extent      int       Maximum X extent (X + width)\n  +0xc    4     min_y_offset      int       Minimum Y offset value\n  +0x10   4     reserved          int       Reserved/unused\n  +0x14   4     effect_count      int       Count of active effects\n  +0x18   4     effect_list_head  pointer   Linked list head of effects\n  \nStructure Layout (pEffectNode):\n  Offset  Size  Field Name        Type      Description\n  +0x0    2     x_coordinate      word      X placement coordinate\n  +0x2    2     y_coordinate      word      Y placement coordinate\n  +0x4    4     reserved_1        dword     Reserved field\n  +0x8    4     buffer_size       dword     Buffer size (0xc00 = 3072 bytes)\n  +0xc    4     buffer_ptr        pointer   Pointer to effect data buffer\n  +0x10   4     prev_effect       pointer   Pointer to previous effect in list\n  +0x14   4     reserved_2        dword     Reserved field",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:cf74305d4771ae532690b0cc91f7cbec",
